SCP Idea looking for greenlight 


15 Nov 2020 21:13






Seeking Greenlights:  Yes

Page Type:  SCP Article

Page Layout (Optional):  Special Containment Procedures, Description, Discovery, Transcripts of exploration logs

Elevator Pitch:  As this was my first scp, I wanted to try something that could be rather fun to write about. The basics of the scp is that it is a large metal sphere that when exposed to o2, explodes and expels a liquid that allows the scp to control the body of what it touches. When it control the host, it gets access to all of the previous hosts memories, skills, even if the SCP is destroyed and regenerates.

Central Narrative:  The story of how the SCP was contained and it could be shown in one of the logs. There can also another log about its first interview with a foundation doctor about its thoughts on the foundation, its history and its abilities.

Hook/Attention-Grabber: The scp is unique to others is how it can control multiple people and cause lots of damages if it breaks its containment and gets near a large group of people and exposed to oxygen. It is also a glass cannon in the fact that if it breaks containment, it could cause a lot of damages, as stated before, but also if it fails it would die, regenerate, then die again if not contained again, so in a way, it relies on the foundation to survive.

